invested in Libra and was mentioned to me by another person. They have been investing into the Turkish gaming ecosystem. They are probably worthwhile chatting with.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [71, "Acterra", "", "Series A", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [72, "Felix Ventures", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "From Akin''s Tier 1 list", "", "", "akin can intro", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [73, "Balderton Ventures", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "From Akin''s Tier 1 list", "", "", "akin can intro", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [74, "Lakestar Ventures", "", "Seed / A", "", "[PERSON_NAME_2316]", "", "", 1, "", "P0", "Rejected", "05/17 - The meeting with [PERSON_NAME_8351] and [PERSON_NAME_2328] went well and they asked to reach out and keep them posted. Back then it was too early for them to enter and their notes was: \\"Sorry for the wait from our side. We’re excited about what you are building, but are worried about the high competition and distribution difficulties of mobile puzzle games in the market.\\n\\nHowever, we see dominoes + mini-games as a compelling thesis due to the retention and lowered cpi’s that you can achieve. We think your strategy and the fantastic team that you have put together has real merit, and we’d love to keep in touch for your next round down the line.\\n\\nThanks,\\n[PERSON_NAME_0613] \\n\\n\\"", "They don''t do gaming anymore", "Not investing", "", "KS can intro", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [75, "BBQ Capital", "", "Seed / A", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "W", "Reached out - no response as of 09/11", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [76, "F4 Fund", "", "", "", "Dave Kaye", "", "", "", "", "P2", "", "Spoke with [PERSON_NAME_2329] during early preparation; he was not involved in the active fundraising round.\\n\\nSector expertise in gaming appears light, and investment posture seems more follower than lead.\\n\\nCultural alignment felt modest.\\n\\nStage fit: typically invests at pre-seed; not aligned with our current round size/stage.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [77, "Treo VC", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "P2", "Initial Contact", "They do b2b AI for Turkish [PERSON_NAME_0305], likely not a good fit. Inbound so we shared the material", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [78, "T-accelerate", "", "", "", "Carol Wong", "", "", "", "", "P0", "First Pitch", "[PERSON_NAME_2330] that we contact them, they are interested pitch next week", "First pitch being scheduled as of 09/11", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [79, "NCsoft", "", "", "", "Anel Ceman", "", "", "", "", "P0", "Second Pitch", "Know their head of strategy, Leonard Hayes had the initial contact. Perfect synnergy in terms of the long term roadmap, they are interested in our engine.", "First pitch went well, we have a follow-up engine conversation with them on 09/15", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [80, "Mattel", "", "", "", "Tim Steudler", "", "", "", "", "P1", "First Pitch", "We talked to them and they are excited about our engine and would like to figure out if they want to partner with us. They asked us to apply for RFP for barbie match-3 game, unfortunately we don''t have time go after it", "I need to follow up with them to see if there is interest from investment stand point", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [81, "Sciplay", "", "", "", "Danny Moy", "", "", "", "", "P1", "Initial Contact", "They know us well", "Reached out - no response as of 09/11", "IH to reach out", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], [82, "Superplay", "", "", "", "Jaako Harlas", "", "", "", "", "P1", "Initial Contact", "[PERSON_NAME_6550] recommended that I reach to him directly", "Reached out - no response as of 09/